   Initial unconsolidated fine sediment file                                  [path and name]: CSE/Yarmouth/in/GY_u_f.asc
   Initial unconsolidated sand sediment file                                  [path and name]: CSE/Yarmouth/in/GY_u_s.asc
   Initial unconsolidated coarse sediment file                                [path and name]: CSE/Yarmouth/in/GY_u_g.asc
   Initial consolidated fine sediment file                                    [path and name]: CSE/Yarmouth/in/GY_c_f.asc
   Initial consolidated sand sediment file                                    [path and name]: CSE/Yarmouth/in/GY_c_s.asc
   Initial consolidated coarse sediment file                                  [path and name]: CSE/Yarmouth/in/GY_c_g.asc

